#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:1
#: 803b6ff941c847f89d22d436554e946a
msgid "FSM and Topics"
msgstr "状态机与话题"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:3
#: a42eb61353ea41d981fbff1c0a2d5903
msgid ""
"Finite-state machines in this stack live in "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control). "
"Shared primitives are in `libraries/arms_controller_common/` "
"(`StateHome`, `StateHold`, `StateMoveJ`, `FSMCommandPublisher`). "
"Cartesian EE topics are owned by "
"[`arms_target_manager`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_target_manager/README.md)"
" (`PoseBasedReferenceManager`)."
msgstr ""
"本技术栈的有限状态机在 [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control)。共享原语在 "
"`libraries/arms_controller_common/`（`StateHome`、`StateHold`、`StateMoveJ`、`FSMCommandPublisher`）。笛卡尔末端话题由"
" [`arms_target_manager`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_target_manager/README.md)（`PoseBasedReferenceManager`）持有。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 5dcd0c6c4367438986f08d9c2492e376
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "权威来源"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:8
#: 568c813bf6e14d1ab572fdd0355fc139
msgid ""
"`/fsm_command` is **`std_msgs/Int32`**, not `String`, and not wheeled-arm"
" strings such as `stand` / `walk` / `arm_teleop`."
msgstr ""
"`/fsm_command` 是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**，不是 `String`，也不是 `stand` / `walk` / "
"`arm_teleop` 这类轮式臂字符串。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:10
#: c9c094133f3e4ff48f4f5437f6be6ef0
msgid ""
"`/fsm_state` is also **`std_msgs/Int32`** (latched) — "
"[ros2_robot_interface API_REFERENCE](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) and the [panthera-ht"
" README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/panthera-"
"ht/README.EN.md)."
msgstr ""
"`/fsm_state` 同样是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**（锁存）——见 [ros2_robot_interface "
"API_REFERENCE](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) 与 [panthera-ht "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/panthera-"
"ht/README.EN.md)。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:12
#: 304242480035439b997aa7cb64844b14
msgid ""
"`/mode_command` is **`std_msgs/String`** on the WBC stack "
"(`send_mode_command` in ros2_robot_interface: `BODY_TRACKING`, "
"`ARMS_COUPLED`, `BASE_LOCK`, …). It is **not** an FSM String and not a "
"stand-in for `/fsm_command`."
msgstr ""
"WBC 栈上的 `/mode_command` 是 **`std_msgs/String`**（ros2_robot_interface 的 "
"`send_mode_command`：`BODY_TRACKING`、`ARMS_COUPLED`、`BASE_LOCK` 等）。它**不是**"
" FSM 字符串，也不能代替 `/fsm_command`。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:14
#: 25df42a248154ed89ccd3d04ee34b0ce
msgid ""
"Cartesian EE goals are `/left_target`, `/left_target/stamped`, "
"`/left_target/twist`, and `/left_target/relative` (and the right / dual "
"counterparts), not a stack-wide `/target_pose`. Per-controller extras: "
"the controller pages and package READMEs. Python mapping: "
"[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)."
msgstr ""
"笛卡尔末端目标是 "
"`/left_target`、`/left_target/stamped`、`/left_target/twist`、`/left_target/relative`（以及右侧"
" / 双臂对应话题），不是全栈统一的 `/target_pose`。各控制器额外话题见对应页面与软件包 README。Python "
"对照：[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:17
