#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:193
#: 3a01aaa31f5243b3a638933dc811461d
msgid "Whole-body mode (`/mode_command`)"
msgstr "全身模式（`/mode_command`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:195
#: f3e4e8c339464900b58fdb6e3e958b37
msgid ""
"`/mode_command` is **`std_msgs/String`** on the **全身 / WBC** stack. It is"
" not `/fsm_command`. Same availability as the body/head Cartesian topics "
"above: 分体 and default mock demos do not start this path. Typical Python: "
"`send_mode_command`, then `wait_until_mode_commands_applied` against "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` "
"(`arms_ros2_control_msgs/WbcCurrentState`). API_REFERENCE: FSM is usually"
" already **OCS2**, or the controller may ignore the mode. API_REFERENCE "
"does **not** map `HEAD_*` strings onto `send_mode_command`; head 6D is "
"gated by `WbcCurrentState.head_state`."
msgstr ""
"在**全身 / WBC** 栈上，`/mode_command` 是 **`std_msgs/String`**。它不是 "
"`/fsm_command`。可用性与上面的身体/头部笛卡尔话题相同：分体和默认 mock 演示不会启动这条路径。典型 "
"Python：`send_mode_command`，再对照 "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/WbcCurrentState`）调用"
" `wait_until_mode_commands_applied`。API_REFERENCE：FSM 通常已在 "
"**OCS2**，否则控制器可能忽略该 mode。API_REFERENCE **不会**把 `HEAD_*` 字符串映射到 "
"`send_mode_command`；头部 6D 由 `WbcCurrentState.head_state` 门控。"

